# Walkthrough - Course Content Organization

I have enhanced the course detail page to provide a more organized and user-friendly experience for browsing course materials.

## Changes Made

### Files Tab
- **Canvas Folder View**: Files are now organized into a hierarchical folder structure based on their Canvas paths. Users can navigate through folders with breadcrumbs and an "Up one level" control.
- **Type View**: Files can be grouped by their file type (PDF, JPG, etc.), making it easier to find specific types of documents.
- **Premium UI**: Added icons for folders and files, improved transitions, and a cleaner table layout.

### Modules Tab
- **Search Functionality**: A new search bar allows users to filter module items by title across all modules.
- **Expand/Collapse All**: Users can now quickly expand or collapse all modules to get a high-level overview or dive into details.
- **Improved Interaction**: Each module can be individually toggled, with smooth animations and clear indicators of the item count and unlock status.

